# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Durable storage (REQUIRED in production / on Vercel)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The queue is saved to a single row in Supabase. These are read ONLY on the
# server — the service-role key is never sent to the browser.
# Find them in Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# In local development you may leave these blank to use a JSON file under ./data.
# In production, if these are missing the app fails clearly instead of losing data.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Login gate (REQUIRED in production / on Vercel)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When set, the dashboard requires this password. On a hosted deployment this
# is mandatory: if it is missing the dashboard fails closed (locks itself and
# shows a configuration message) instead of exposing the queue to anyone.
# Leave blank locally to skip the login during development.
OPS_PASSWORD=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI drafting (optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# With a key, drafts use OpenAI. Without it, high-quality built-in drafts are used.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Model to use when OPENAI_API_KEY is set. Default: gpt-4o-mini
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LinkedIn publishing (optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set BOTH to let "Approve & publish" post to LinkedIn via the official API.
# If either is missing, approving a post saves it as a local dry run instead.
LINKEDIN_ACCESS_TOKEN=
LINKEDIN_AUTHOR_URN=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scout — iPhone Safari capture + Hermes job (optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Authorizes the on-demand Hermes worker that turns captured LinkedIn posts into
# comment drafts for approval. Read ONLY on the server; never sent to a browser.
# If unset, the Scout job endpoints fail closed (503) and no batches process.
# The iPhone pairing (capture) token is NOT an env var — it is created in the
# Scout tab and stored only as a domain-separated hash.
SCOUT_JOB_TOKEN=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Branding
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Mobi LinkedIn Ops
